    "order": "Ascending unrounded distance; exact ties by id in plain UTF-16 code-unit order (so node/10 sorts before node/9).",
    "display": "Under 1 km: nearest 10 m. 1 km to under 10 km: nearest 0.1 km with one decimal. 10 km and over: nearest 1 km. Round half up on the unrounded metres; a value that rounds up to 1000 m is shown as 1.0 km and one that rounds up to 10.0 km as 10 km. Numbers use the locale's separators (en 1,234.5; fi 1 234,5).",
    "labels": "Row label is the en message '{distance} straight line' or the fi message '{distance} linnuntietä'.",
    "labelComparison": "Before comparing, replace U+00A0 and U+202F with U+0020; formatters differ in which space they use."
  },
